        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7039/0, Traditional Arched Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arched 7 Inch Flush Pull has a classic look that will blend seamlessly into almost any decor. The arched shaped paired with the beveled edge makes this sliding door flush pull a stunning example of traditional home decor. The  Traditional Arched Flush Pull is available in a wide selection of beautiful finishes. It comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/arched-7-inch-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-7039-l\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/arched-7-inch-pocket-door-keyed-entry-set-omnia-7039-a\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Arched Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7039-0-specifications.pdf?v=1704262371\"><b>Omnia 7039 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually:</b> one (1) rectangle flush pull and all mounting hardware. <b>For One Side of (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
